OL,3,GNEWSAMore talks over Drumcree dispute
OL,4,Aas stalemate continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Secretary, Sir
OL,7,FChris Bryant, is planning further talks
OL,8,Fwith community leaders on Wednesday
OL,9,Fover the the controversial Drumcree
OL,10,Fmarch.
OL,12,FIt comes after lawyers for the Garvaghy
OL,13,FRoad Residents Coalition issued a fresh
OL,14,Flegal bid to try to prevent the march
OL,15,Ffrom going ahead.
OL,17,FMembers of the Orange Order are still
OL,18,Fwaiting to begin their permitted
OL,19,Fparade, which was due to take place on
OL,20,FSunday, and walk down the
OL,21,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,22,FPortadown.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
